nsfw.onnx is Marqo/nsfw-image-detection-384, licensed under the
Apache License 2.0.

    Source:  https://huggingface.co/Marqo/nsfw-image-detection-384
    ONNX:    https://huggingface.co/ICIJ/nsfw-image-detection-384-onnx
    License: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

It is compiled into the binary with include_bytes! and used only by the
NSFW lock, to score a thumbnail. It takes RGB [1, 3, 384, 384] scaled to
-1..1 (mean and standard deviation of 0.5) and emits two logits, in the
order nsfw, sfw.
